[00:00.17] One, two, three, four!
[00:00.17]一，二，三，四！
[00:02.22] Who y'all came to see tonight?
[00:02.22]你们今晚来找谁？
[00:06.53] Who gon' get the ladies feeling something? (Who)
[00:06.53]谁能让这些女士们有感觉？（谁）
[00:10.92] We gon' lock this groove in tight (Yeah, huh, well lock it in then!)
[00:10.92]让我们保持这样的最佳状态(耶，哈，是的，保持它!）
[00:14.50] Don't have us let this groove down for nothing (Get down!)
[00:14.50]不要让我们无缘无故地放弃这最佳状态(趴下!)
[00:20.62] Oh, oh
[00:20.62]哦，哦
[00:24.66] Lock, lemme got
[00:24.66]是的，让我得到了
[00:26.62] Whatcha came to see? (Woo!)
[00:26.62]你来看什么?(哇!)
[00:28.95] Oh, oh (Where we at?)
[00:28.95]哦，哦（我们在哪里？）
[00:31.42] It's about that time to get out your seats and make some noise for our host
[00:31.42]是时候离开你们的座位，为主人制造一些噪音了
[00:34.92] Give it up for Bootsy Collins!
[00:34.92]为布兹·柯林斯鼓掌!
[00:36.47] Well alright!
[00:36.47]好吧，好吧！
[00:46.58] Fellas, I hope you got something in your cup
[00:46.58]伙计们，希望你们的杯子里有些东西
[00:50.03] And ladies? Don't be afraid to make your way to the stage
[00:50.03]至于女士们，不要害怕走上舞台
[00:55.84] For a band that I name... Silk Sonic!
[00:55.84]为一个我命名的乐队…丝绸之声!
